; Strict decrease of the actual remainder norm in Eisenstein division.
; r*conjugate(y)=a+b*omega gives N(r)*N(y)=N(a+b*omega).
; The bounded-coordinate estimate and nonzero multiplier reflection
; prove N(r)<N(y); all norm representatives are actual witnesses.
(#alias eisenstein = ./eisenstein-defs.lim::eisenstein)
(#alias eisenstein-zero = ./eisenstein-defs.lim::eisenstein-zero)
(#alias eisenstein-equal = ./eisenstein-defs.lim::eisenstein-equal)
(#alias eisenstein-multiply = ./eisenstein-defs.lim::eisenstein-multiply)
